<p>Delivery depends on the event and the seller. It may be electronic, a mobile transfer or physical shipping, and some tickets are released closer to the event date, so tickets that have not arrived right away are not always a problem. If something looks wrong, <a href="/ticket-customer-service">contact us</a> well before doors open.</p>
<p>Most events accept mobile tickets, and printing is only needed if the event page says so. Bring your ticket and a government-issued ID if the venue requires one. The <a href="/ticket-faq">ticket FAQ</a> covers entry rules, age limits and what you can bring.</p>
