<details class="so-faq"><summary>How do I transfer tickets to a friend?</summary><p>It depends on the event and how your tickets are delivered. Your order confirmation explains the delivery method, and <a href="/ticket-customer-service">customer service</a> can help if you are unsure.</p></details>
